<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3151" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήρ-ᾰτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κηραίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>undefiled, pure</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕδωρ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					24.303
				</span></i>
			; <i>inviolate</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῦμα,
			ὄμβρος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				471
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				690
			</span></i> (lyr.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρυσός</span>
			<i>pure</i> gold, <i><span class="en">
				Archil.
				<u>Supp.</u>
				4
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alcm.
				23.54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.10
			</span></i>.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ά</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Simon.
				64
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				503a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				303e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλόξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Secund.
					<u>Sent.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			; <i>untouched, unhurt</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἶκος
				καὶ κλῆρος, κτήματα</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				15.498
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				17.532
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπαρτίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippon.
					26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκάφος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					661
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁνίαι</span>
			<i>strong</i> reins, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				5.32
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλόκοι</span>
			<i>unshorn</i> locks, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Ion</u>
				1266
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λειμών</span>
			<i>unmown</i> meadow, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				73
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἐμπόριον</span>
			<i>virgin</i> market, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.152
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φιλία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Hier.</u>
					3.4
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιστήμη, ἤθη</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Phdr.</u>
				247d
			</span></i>, 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				735c
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. φάρμακα</span> spells
				<i>that have all their power</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				4.157
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of persons,
				<i>undefiled</i>, a virgin, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				675
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				84c
			</span></i>d; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. λέχος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					575
				</span></i>
			: c. dat., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήρατος ἄλγεσι, τύχαις</span>
			<i>untouched by</i> woes, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				1113
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>HF</u>
				1314
			</span></i>: c. gen., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. κακῶν</span>
			<i>without taint</i> of ill, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Hipp.</u>
				949
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ὠδίνων</span>
			<i>free from</i> throes of child-birth, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				1.974
			</span></i>, etc.: poet. 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηρότατος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.249
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κεράννυμι</span>) <i>unmixed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποτόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pers.</u>
					614
				</span></i>
			.</div>
